#
#  Benchmark test for 98 all atom DMPC lipids (a modified CHARMM force field)
#  and 3655 flexible SPC water
#  Flexible molecular models and double time steps
#
Main_filename dmpc_NM
Verbose_level 5
Path_DB    ../moldb
Read_restart no
#Dump_restart 10000
Check_only f
#
Molecule_types 2
dmpc_NM   98
H2O     2700
#
Box  54. 54. 62.
Change_V no
Change_T no
Nose_thermostat 303. 50.
Barostate_NH  1. 1000.
Barostate_anisotropic yes
PBC rect
COM_check yes 0
#
Time_step 2.
Number_steps 1000
Serie_average 1000
Double_timestep 10
#Constrain 0.0001 1 1
R_cutoff 13.
R_short 5.
Neighbour_list 10
Electrostatics Ewald 2.6 8.
Cut_forces 1.
#
Startup xmol
#
Output 1
Average_int no
#
End
